From 92fa871e273805008f538a2c00e84555fd400d42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:49:10 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] wayland: Carry native per-view source rectangles with stereo
 content

Add a version-four source rectangle without changing the SBS-left content value. Apply it independently within each view and retain fractional texture coordinates for this explicit geometry.

Assisted-by: gpt-6-astra via Codex
